ull},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-21T11:05:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T17:50:20Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T17:49:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot.NET 4.7.2 (4.7.2.stable.mono)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot v4.7.2.stable.mono - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 - i9-14900K\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen enabling Console logging in Editor Settings > Dotnet > Build (or rather not disabling it) and setting the Verbosity Level to Diagnostic, a build of project including only a single scene with a single CSharp file can take up to 90 seconds. During this time the Godot Editor is unresponsive / hangs. (This is on a i914900K Processor with 32GB DDR5RAM at 4800MT/s and a Samsung 990Pro NVMe).\nWhen creating a binary log, it is quite clear that the actual build finishes in under 2 seconds, but the duration is marked as 90 seconds instead. The MSBuild process must therefore be held open \"forcefully\".\nWhen reducing the verbosity of the build, the build time drastically reduces as well.\nWhen disabling the console log completely, the build time is exactly as it actually happens in the dotnet build.\n\nIt seems that the process of reading the output of the dotnet build and / or writing it into the Editors MSBuild output window is the actual culprit of the long wait time.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Install and start Godot.NET\n- Set the Dotnet log verbosity to \"Detailed\"\n- Create a simple scene with a C# script \n  (follow the tutorial on 2D Game up to the Player creation and its script)\n- Start a build or Run your Project\n\n<img width=\"680\" height=\"550\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a23a5e52-5983-40fa-931e-e32052f365bd\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Intro2dGame.net.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32463002/Intro2dGame.net.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123668/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}